#   - exports.parse  / function parse          (lines 244-275)
#   - function SemVer (constructor)            (lines 291-362)
#   - SemVer.prototype.format                  (lines 364-370)
#   - RE_FULL  = exports.re[FULL]  src index 11; FULLPLAIN at lines 111-116
#   - RE_LOOSE = exports.re[LOOSE] src index 12; LOOSEPLAIN at lines 121-126
#   - MAX_LENGTH=256 (line 22); MAX_SAFE_INTEGER (lines 23-24)
